'''Alolan Muk''' (Japanese: '''アローラベトベトン''' ''Alolan Betbeton'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

