==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Alolan Muk|58}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion; both cards have the Power of Alchemy Ability.
*{{a|Power of Alchemy}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Alolan Muk can have.
*{{m|Sludge Bomb}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Alolan Muk can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

